<title>USA: Coda gets $2.3 mln from private offering.</title>
<headline>Coda gets $2.3 mln from private offering.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE, Minn. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coda Music Technology Inc, which develops music learning and composition products, said Friday it received net proceeds of $2.3 million from a private securities offering.</p>
<p>Proceeds of the offering will be used for sales and marketing, development of the company's Vivace product and repertoire and working capital, Coda said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
